<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= guild.name %> — Vercel Style Dashboard</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Kanit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* ==========================================================================
       Vercel Geist Design System — Minimalist & Enterprise Grade
       ========================================================================== */

    :root {
      --bg: #000000;
      --surface: #0A0A0A;
      --card-bg: #0C0C0C;
      --card-footer: #080808;
      --border: #222222;
      --border-hover: #383838;
      --text: #EDEDED;
      --text-secondary: #888888;
      --text-muted: #666666;
      --accent-white: #FFFFFF;
      --accent-blue: #0070F3;
      --accent-green: #10B981;
      --accent-red: #EE0000;
      --radius: 6px;
      --radius-lg: 8px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Geist', 'Kanit', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Vercel Global Nav */
    .vercel-nav {
      height: 64px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 24px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
    }
    .vercel-nav-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .vercel-delta-logo {
      width: 22px;
      height: 19px;
      fill: #FFF;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .vercel-sep {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 300;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .vercel-project-chip {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .vercel-project-chip img {
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .vercel-badge-env {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--accent-green);
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
    }
    .env-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent-green);
    }

    .vercel-nav-right {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .btn-vercel-white {
      background: var(--accent-white);
      color: #000;
      border: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 7px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      transition: background 0.15s, opacity 0.15s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .btn-vercel-white:hover {
      background: #EAEAEA;
    }
    .btn-vercel-ghost {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: border-color 0.15s, color 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-vercel-ghost:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-hover);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* Subheader & Breadcrumbs */
    .vercel-subheader {
      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 24px 0;
    }
    .vercel-guild-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .meta-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .meta-icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .meta-icon-ph {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #141414;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #FFF;
    }
    .meta-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .meta-sub {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* Vercel Underline Tabs */
    .vercel-tabs-nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .vercel-tabs-nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .vercel-tab-item {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 12px 2px;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
      position: relative;
      transition: color 0.15s;
      user-select: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .vercel-tab-item:hover {
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .vercel-tab-item.active {
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .vercel-tab-item.active::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -1px;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: #FFF;
    }

    /* Main Container */
    .vercel-main-content {
      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 24px 80px;
    }

    .vercel-tab-pane {
      display: none;
    }
    .vercel-tab-pane.active {
      display: block;
      animation: tabFadeIn 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    @keyframes tabFadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Vercel Card Specification */
    .card-pro {
      background: var(--card-bg) !important;
      border: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg) !important;
      margin-bottom: 24px !important;
      overflow: hidden !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
    }
    .card-pro-header {
      padding: 24px 24px 18px !important;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 0 !important;
    }
    .card-pro-title {
      font-size: 16px !important;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      color: #FFF !important;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .card-pro p {
      padding: 0 24px !important;
      margin-top: 18px !important;
      font-size: 14px !important;
      color: var(--text-secondary) !important;
      line-height: 1.6 !important;
    }
    .card-pro > div[style*="grid"] {
      padding: 0 24px 24px !important;
      margin-top: 18px !important;
    }
    .card-pro > div:not([class]):not([style*="grid"]) {
      padding: 0 24px 24px !important;
    }
    .card-pro button.btn-go,
    .card-pro button.btn-setup {
      margin: 0 24px 24px !important;
    }

    /* Vercel Card Option Grid (For Auto-Setup & Templates) */
    .server-card {
      background: #000000 !important;
      border: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
      border-radius: var(--radius) !important;
      padding: 18px !important;
      transition: border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s !important;
      text-align: left !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }
    .server-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-hover) !important;
      background: #0A0A0A !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
    .server-card h3 {
      font-size: 15px !important;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      color: #FFF !important;
      margin-bottom: 6px !important;
    }
    .server-card p {
      padding: 0 !important;
      margin: 0 0 14px 0 !important;
      font-size: 13px !important;
      color: var(--text-secondary) !important;
    }

    /* Vercel Form Controls */
    .form-control-pro {
      background: #000000 !important;
      border: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
      border-radius: var(--radius) !important;
      color: #FFF !important;
      font-family: inherit !important;
      font-size: 14px !important;
      padding: 9px 12px !important;
      transition: border-color 0.15s !important;
      width: 100% !important;
    }
    .form-control-pro:focus {
      outline: none !important;
      border-color: #555555 !important;
    }

    /* Vercel Buttons */
    .btn-go, .btn-setup {
      background: var(--accent-white) !important;
      color: #000000 !important;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      font-size: 13px !important;
      padding: 8px 18px !important;
      border-radius: var(--radius) !important;
      border: none !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
      cursor: pointer !important;
      transition: background 0.15s !important;
    }
    .btn-go:hover, .btn-setup:hover {
      background: #CCCCCC !important;
      transform: none !important;
      opacity: 1 !important;
    }

    /* Toast */
    .toast-pro {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px;
      right: 24px;
      background: #0C0C0C;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 12px 18px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #FFF;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      z-index: 9999;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Vercel Top Navigation -->
  <header class="vercel-nav">
    <div class="vercel-nav-left">
      <a href="/dashboard" class="vercel-project-chip">
        <% if (guild.iconURL) { %>
          <img src="<%= guild.iconURL %>" alt="">
        <% } %>
        <span><%= guild.name %></span>
      </a>
      <span class="vercel-badge-env">
        <span class="env-dot"></span>
        Production
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="vercel-nav-right">
      <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-vercel-ghost">
        <i class="fas fa-th-large"></i> เซิร์ฟเวอร์ทั้งหมด
      </a>
      <button class="btn-vercel-white" onclick="saveEverything()">
        <i class="fas fa-check"></i> บันทึกทุกอย่าง
      </button>
      <a href="/auth/logout" class="btn-vercel-ghost" style="padding: 7px 10px;" title="ออกจากระบบ">
        <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Vercel Subheader -->
  <div class="vercel-subheader">
    <div class="vercel-guild-meta">
      <div class="meta-left">
        <% if (guild.iconURL) { %>
          <img src="<%= guild.iconURL %>" alt="" class="meta-icon">
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="meta-icon-ph"><%= guild.name.charAt(0) %></div>
        <% } %>
        <div>
          <h1 class="meta-title"><%= guild.name %></h1>
          <div class="meta-sub">
            <span><strong style="color:#FFF;"><%= guild.memberCount %></strong> สมาชิก</span>
            <span>&bull;</span>
            <span><strong style="color:#FFF;"><%= stats.totalWarnings %></strong> คำเตือน</span>
            <span>&bull;</span>
            <span><strong style="color:#FFF;"><%= stats.totalActions %></strong> บันทึก Mod</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="https://discord.com/channels/<%= guild.id %>" target="_blank" class="btn-vercel-ghost">
          <i class="fab fa-discord"></i> เปิดใน Discord
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Vercel Minimalist Underline Tabs -->
    <nav class="vercel-tabs-nav">
      <div class="vercel-tab-item active" data-tab="overview" onclick="switchSection('overview', this)">
        <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> ติดตั้งด่วน
      </div>
      <div class="vercel-tab-item" data-tab="security" onclick="switchSection('security', this)">
        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> ยืนยันตัวตน & ยศ
      </div>
      <div class="vercel-tab-item" data-tab="welcome" onclick="switchSection('welcome', this)">
        <i class="fas fa-hand-sparkles"></i> ระบบต้อนรับ
      </div>
      <div class="vercel-tab-item" data-tab="channels" onclick="switchSection('channels', this)">
        <i class="fas fa-paint-brush"></i> แต่งห้อง & สถิติ
      </div>
      <div class="vercel-tab-item" data-tab="logs" onclick="switchSection('logs', this)">
        <i class="fas fa-sliders-h"></i> เครื่องมือ & Logs
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <main class="vercel-main-content">
    <!-- Toast -->
    <div id="toast" class="toast-pro" style="display: none;">
      <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10B981;"></i>
      <span id="toast-msg">บันทึกสำเร็จ!</span>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 1: OVERVIEW & AUTO SETUP -->
    <!-- TAB 1: OVERVIEW & AUTO SETUP -->
    <div class="vercel-tab-pane active" id="tab-overview">
      <div style="display:block;" id="sec-auto-setup">
          <div class="card-pro" style="border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.04);">
            <div class="card-pro-header">
              <div class="card-pro-title" style="color: #10B981;">
                <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> ติดตั้งระบบแบบ Full Auto Setup (คลิกเดียวครบทั้งเซิร์ฟเวอร์)
              </div>
              <span style="background: #10B981; color: #000; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.75rem;">ALL IN ONE</span>
            </div>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 22px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              ระบบจะทำการสร้าง <strong>ยศ (Roles)</strong>, <strong>ห้องและหมวดหมู่ (Channels)</strong>, <strong>ล็อกสิทธิ์ Read-Only และซ่อนห้อง Staff</strong>, <strong>เปิดระบบ Welcome</strong>, <strong>ส่งปุ่มยืนยันตัวตน (Verify)</strong>, และ <strong>ผูก Auto Role</strong> ให้อัตโนมัติทันที
            </p>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
              <div class="server-card" onclick="selectAutoTheme('security')" id="autotheme-security" style="cursor: pointer; border: 2px solid #10B981; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08); text-align: left; padding: 20px;">
                <h3 style="color: #10B981; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">🛡️ 7 ระดับสิทธิ์ความปลอดภัย</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;">Founder, Admin, Staff, VIP, Bot, Verified, Member ล็อกและซ่อนห้องเด็ดขาด ป้องกันสแปม 100%</p>
                <span class="btn-go" style="width: auto; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem;">มาตรฐานความปลอดภัย</span>
              </div>

              <div class="server-card" onclick="selectAutoTheme('gaming')" id="autotheme-gaming" style="cursor: pointer; text-align: left; padding: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #FFF;">🎮 เกมมิ่ง & ตี้เกม</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;">ห้องแชทเกมเมอร์ หาเพื่อนเล่นเกม คลิปไฮไลท์ และห้อง Duo/Squad จำกัดคน</p>
                <span class="btn-setup" style="width: auto; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem;">สำหรับสายเกม</span>
              </div>

              <div class="server-card" onclick="selectAutoTheme('community')" id="autotheme-community" style="cursor: pointer; text-align: left; padding: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #FFF;">🌟 คอมมูนิตี้มาตรฐาน</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;">ยศ Founder, Admin, Member ทั่วไป สบายตา ใช้งานง่าย เหมาะกับกลุ่มเพื่อน</p>
                <span class="btn-setup" style="width: auto; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; background: #38BDF8;">ยอดนิยม</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <input type="hidden" id="selected_auto_theme" value="security">

            <div style="margin-bottom: 22px;">
              <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; cursor: pointer; color: #FFF; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                <input type="checkbox" id="auto_with_stats" checked style="width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--accent-emerald);">
                <span>ติดตั้งห้องเสียงนับสถิติเซิร์ฟเวอร์ (Server Stats Counters) ด้านบนสุดด้วย</span>
              </label>
            </div>

            <button class="btn-go" id="btn-run-auto" onclick="runAutoSetupFromWeb()" style="width: auto; padding: 12px 28px; font-size: 1rem;">
              <i class="fas fa-magic"></i> กดรันระบบ Full Auto Setup ทันที
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ==================== 2. AUTO ROLES CREATOR ==================== -->
      <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <div style="display:block;" id="sec-auto-roles">
          <div class="card-pro" style="border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4); background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.04);">
            <div class="card-pro-header">
              <div class="card-pro-title" style="color: #F59E0B;">
                <i class="fas fa-crown"></i> ระบบ Auto สร้างชุดยศ (Setup Roles อัตโนมัติ)
              </div>
              <span style="background: #F59E0B; color: #000; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.75rem;">ROLES ONLY</span>
            </div>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 22px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              บอทจะสร้างชุดยศพร้อมตั้งค่าสีและสิทธิ์ให้อัตโนมัติทันที <strong>โดยไม่แก้ไขหรือลบห้องเดิม</strong> ในเซิร์ฟเวอร์ของคุณ
            </p>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
              <div class="server-card" onclick="selectRoleCreatorTheme('security')" id="roletheme-security" style="cursor: pointer; border: 2px solid #F59E0B; background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08); text-align: left; padding: 20px;">
                <h3 style="color: #F59E0B; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">🛡️ 7 ระดับสิทธิ์ความปลอดภัย</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5;">👑 FOUNDER, 🛡️ ADMIN, 🔧 STAFF, 💎 VIP, 🤖 Bot, ✅ Verified, 👥 Member</p>
              </div>

              <div class="server-card" onclick="selectRoleCreatorTheme('gaming')" id="roletheme-gaming" style="cursor: pointer; text-align: left; padding: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #FFF;">🎮 ชุดยศสายเกมมิ่ง & ตี้เกม</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5;">👑 Owner, 🛡️ Admin, ⚔️ Moderator, 💎 VIP, 🎮 Gamer, 🤖 Bot, 🔒 Unverified</p>
              </div>

              <div class="server-card" onclick="selectRoleCreatorTheme('community')" id="roletheme-community" style="cursor: pointer; text-align: left; padding: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #FFF;">🌟 ชุดยศคอมมูนิตี้มาตรฐาน</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5;">👑 ผู้ก่อตั้ง, 🛡️ แอดมิน, 👮 เจ้าหน้าที่, ✨ สมาชิกพิเศษ, 👥 สมาชิก, 🤖 Bot</p>
              </div>

              <div class="server-card" onclick="selectRoleCreatorTheme('aesthetic')" id="roletheme-aesthetic" style="cursor: pointer; text-align: left; padding: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #FFF;">✨ ชุดยศมินิมอล & คาเฟ่</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5;">👑 Mastermind, 🛡️ Guardian, 🌷 Supporter, ☕ Resident, 🤖 Helper</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <input type="hidden" id="selected_role_creator_theme" value="security">

